# Keep the root build context (edu_ai / Langflow image) lean — exclude data,
# caches, and VCS. Source dirs (api/, search/, langflow_flows/, postgres/, …) are
# NOT excluded. The Dockerfile only COPYs requirements-langflow.txt +
# search/eduai_normalize, so nothing here is needed by the build.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
postgres_data/
langflow_data/
langflow_data_1_8/
langgraph_data/
pgadmin_exports/
uploads/
sqllite_export/
db_export/
Ingestion testing documents/
Podklady pro testy/
*.dump
